{
  "title": "ExtensionKindMap",
  "description": "Type-level twin of the runtime `extensionKindRegistry`: file suffix → asset kind, for bare-string path inference in `Assets.from()`/`get()`/`load()` (asset-system v2 §5). Restricted to LEAF-CAPABLE kinds, exactly mirroring the runtime `registerExtensionKind` calls in `seamless.ts`. Extend by declaration merging, like ExtensionTypeMap: ```ts declare module '@codexo/exojs' { interface ExtensionKindMap { 'atlas.json': 'spriteAtlas'; } } ```",
